WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
If this is your prep, this video will walk you through

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.640
exactly how to take it. Just follow along step by step.

3
00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:12.000
Your prep contains three packets, one Mango flavored packet,

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.790
and two Fruit Punch packets. You'll also need the mixing container that comes

5
00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:17.520
with it and water.

6
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:23.200
Start with your first dose. This is the Mango packet and you'll take it the

7
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:23.920
evening before

8
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.760
your procedure. Open the Mango packet and pour it into the container.

9
00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:34.070
Add 16 ounces of water up to the fill line. Shake or stir it until it's

10
00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:35.120
completely dissolved.

11
00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:42.310
Now take your time. Slowly drink all of it within 30 minutes. There's no rush,

12
00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:43.200
just keep sipping

13
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:47.990
steadily. Once you've finished, refill the same container or a 16 ounce cup

14
00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:48.800
with water.

15
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.160
Drink this glass of water within 30 minutes too.

16
00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:02.230
Your second dose happens 12 hours after the first. This time you'll use both

17
00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:03.120
Fruit Punch packets.

18
00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:09.440
Open both Fruit Punch packets and pour them into the container. Add water to

19
00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:10.960
the 16 ounce fill line

20
00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:15.750
and shake or stir until dissolved. Just like before, slowly drink all of it

21
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.360
within 30 minutes.

22
00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:22.190
Then refill the container with 16 ounces of water and finish that within 30

23
00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:22.960
minutes.

24
00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:28.080
The timing of this second dose is really important. Make sure you take it at

25
00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.040
the right time so your

26
00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:33.800
prep is as effective as possible. You must drink all of the prep solution as

27
00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:34.000
directed,

28
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.080
even if you're already passing clear liquid. I know it can feel like enough,

29
00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:38.560
but finishing

30
00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:42.640
the entire dose is what gives us the clearest view during your procedure. If

31
00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:43.760
the prep isn't

32
00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:47.680
completed as directed, we may need to reschedule and neither of us wants that.

33
00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:50.160
After you've finished

34
00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:54.330
each dose, keep drinking clear liquids throughout the evening. Staying hydrated

35
00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:55.280
will help you feel

36
00:01:55.280 --> 00:02:00.070
better and help the prep do its job. If you experience any discomfort from

37
00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:00.880
frequent trips to

38
00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:04.510
the bathroom, applying a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can

39
00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:07.120
really help. That's it.

40
00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:11.910
You've got this. Follow the timing. Finish the full dose and stay hydrated. If

41
00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:12.400
you have any

42
00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.840
questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office. We're here to help.
